        {
          "start": 4.34,
          "end": 10.94,
          "text": "Follow the red nose line and blue wing line\ntogether to distinguish its orientation.",
          "line": 0
        },
        {
          "start": 11.26,
          "end": 16.2,
          "text": "The camera also moves, so a screen tilt does\nnot establish a ninety-degree world rotation.",
          "line": 1
        },
        {
          "start": 16.6,
          "end": 20.78,
          "text": "Our next model fixes the spatial axes and\nchanges only the order of the rotations.",
