        },
        {
          "start": 21.16,
          "end": 24.02,
          "text": "다른 축에서는 단순히 각도만 빼면 안 됩니다.",
          "line": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.64,
          "text": "In the defined same-axis model, the current z\nrotation is thirty degrees and the",
          "line": 0
        },
        {
          "start": 6.92,
          "end": 9.72,
          "text": "target is ninety; the remaining rotation is\nsixty, not an additional ninety.",
          "line": 0
        },
        {
          "start": 10.24,
          "end": 15.66,
          "text": "Applying the world difference D to the current\norientation A yields target B: D A equals B.",
          "line": 1
        },
        {
          "start": 16.12,
          "end": 21.16,
          "text": "Thus D equals B times the inverse of A.",
          "line": 1
        },
        {
          "start": 21.16,
          "end": 24.02,
          "text": "This same-axis check does not justify\nsubtracting angles across different axes.",
